1
00:00:00,202 --> 00:00:02,202
(Stuart:)Sheldon hired me to go
shopping with you.

2
00:00:02,204 --> 00:00:04,104
(Amy:)Hold on.

3
00:00:04,106 --> 00:00:07,136
(Amy:)He paid you to get out
of spending time with me?

4
00:00:07,142 --> 00:00:09,442
(Stuart:)No, it's not like that.

5
00:00:09,444 --> 00:00:12,214
(Stuart:)There's a long line
he'd rather stand in.

6
00:00:13,849 --> 00:00:15,549
(Stuart:)So what are we doing?
Old Navy, Build-A-Bear?

7
00:00:15,551 --> 00:00:17,151
(Stuart:)I get paid either way.

8
00:00:19,221 --> 00:00:21,251
(Amy:)We're not going
shopping together.

9
00:00:21,256 --> 00:00:23,256
(Stuart:)You sure?
I'm happy to hold your bag.

10
00:00:23,258 --> 00:00:26,198
(Stuart:)And Sheldon gave me money
for a hotdog on a stick.

11
00:00:27,729 --> 00:00:30,129
(Amy:)Can you understand why
I might be annoyed right now?

12
00:00:30,132 --> 00:00:34,132
(chuckles) Look, lady,
I just work here.

13
00:00:36,605 --> 00:00:40,445
(Howard:)We've waited in a lot of
lines together, haven't we?

14
00:00:40,442 --> 00:00:42,012
(Sheldon:)Remember when we camped out

15
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:43,680
for the Doctor Who panel
at Comic-Con?

16
00:00:43,679 --> 00:00:45,679
(Raj:)Yeah, sleeping under the
stars with other fans

17
00:00:45,681 --> 00:00:47,381
(Raj:)who love the show
as much as we do.

18
00:00:47,382 --> 00:00:50,622
(Leonard:)Waking up, wondering which one
of those fans stole our wallets.

19
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:54,350
SHELDON: Stuart,
what are you doing here?

20
00:00:54,356 --> 00:00:56,326
(Stuart:)Sheldon, you are the most
inconsiderate person

21
00:00:56,325 --> 00:01:00,025
(Stuart:)I have ever met
in my entire life!

